```js
function isPrime(n) {
  if (!Number.isInteger(n) || n < 2) return false;
  if (n === 2) return true;
  if (n % 2 === 0) return false;
  const limit = Math.floor(Math.sqrt(n));
  for (let d = 3; d <= limit; d += 2) {
    if (n % d === 0) return false;
  }
  return true;
}
```

- `1` and non-integers → `false`
- Evens after `2` → `false`
- Odds: trial divide up to `√n`

